  <diagram id="page-UC-01" name="05 - Use Case - Tổng quan Lingora (UC-01)">
    <mxGraphModel dx="0" dy="0" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1420" pageHeight="1540" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#10;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n' Shared academic presentation; identities and authority belong in comments/index.\nskinparam monochrome true\nskinparam backgroundColor white\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam defaultFontSize 14\nskinparam defaultFontColor black\nskinparam titleFontSize 18\nskinparam titleFontColor black\nskinparam ArrowColor black\nskinparam ArrowThickness 1\nskinparam roundCorner 0\nskinparam nodesep 35\nskinparam ranksep 45\nskinparam ActorBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActorBorderColor black\nskinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ParticipantBorderColor black\nskinparam ControlBackgroundColor white\nskinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white\nskinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ClassBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ClassBorderColor black\nskinparam ClassHeaderBackgroundColor white\nskinparam EntityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam EntityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor black\nskinparam StateBackgroundColor white\nskinparam StateBorderColor black\nskinparam PackageBackgroundColor white\nskinparam PackageBorderColor #555555\nskinparam RectangleBackgroundColor white\nskinparam RectangleBorderColor black\nskinparam NoteBackgroundColor white\nskinparam NoteBorderColor black\nskinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #555555\nskinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white\nskinparam sequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor white\n' diagram-id: VIEW-UC-01\n' classification: TARGET\n' Authority: ADR-030–036; docs/use-case-specifications.md current catalog.\n' UC-01 is visually split into public signup/recovery/activation, profile and supporting Login.\n' Login is presentation-only: no canonical UC is added or renumbered.\n' UC-03 reminder retained in catalog but deferred under ADR-031; excluded from MVP.\n' Reassessment deferred under ADR-036; absent from active learner use cases.\nleft to right direction\nskinparam nodesep 28\nskinparam ranksep 55\ntitle Sơ đồ Use Case tổng quan hệ thống Lingora\n\nactor \&quot;Học viên\&quot; as Learner\nactor \&quot;Giáo viên\&quot; as Teacher\nactor \&quot;Quản trị viên\&quot; as Admin\n\nrectangle \&quot;HỆ THỐNG HỌC NGOẠI NGỮ LINGORA\&quot; {\n  package \&quot;Học tập\&quot; {\n    usecase \&quot;Kiểm tra xếp lớp\&quot; as UC02\n    usecase \&quot;Khám phá lộ trình học\&quot; as UC04\n    usecase \&quot;Kiểm tra lên cấp\&quot; as UC05\n    usecase \&quot;Học bài và luyện tập\&quot; as UC06\n    usecase \&quot;Học từ vựng và ôn tập\&quot; as UC07\n    usecase \&quot;Xem tiến độ và chuỗi ngày học\&quot; as UC08\n  }\n  package \&quot;Biên soạn\&quot; {\n    usecase \&quot;Soạn nội dung được phân công\&quot; as UC10\n    usecase \&quot;Nộp bài và nộp lại\&quot; as UC11\n  }\n  package \&quot;Quản trị\&quot; {\n    usecase \&quot;Lập đề cương và phân công\&quot; as UC09\n    usecase \&quot;Thẩm định và xuất bản\&quot; as UC12\n    usecase \&quot;Quản lý tài khoản\&quot; as UC13\n    usecase \&quot;Xem báo cáo và nhật ký\&quot; as UC14\n  }\n  package \&quot;Tài khoản\&quot; {\n    usecase \&quot;Đăng ký tài khoản\&quot; as Signup\n    usecase \&quot;Khôi phục mật khẩu\&quot; as Recovery\n    usecase \&quot;Kích hoạt tài khoản\&quot; as Activation\n    usecase \&quot;Quản lý hồ sơ cá nhân\&quot; as Profile\n  }\n  usecase \&quot;Đăng nhập / Xác thực\&quot; as Login\n}\n\nLearner -- Signup\nLearner -- Recovery\nLearner -- Profile\nLearner -- UC02\nLearner -- UC04\nLearner -- UC05\nLearner -- UC06\nLearner -- UC07\nLearner -- UC08\nTeacher -- Activation\nTeacher -- Recovery\nTeacher -- Profile\nTeacher -- UC10\nTeacher -- UC11\nAdmin -- Recovery\nAdmin -- Profile\nAdmin -- UC09\nAdmin -- UC12\nAdmin -- UC13\nAdmin -- UC14\n\nProfile ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC02 ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC04 ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC05 ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC06 ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC07 ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC08 ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC09 ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC10 ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC11 ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC12 ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC13 ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC14 ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#10;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#10;}" id="plantuml-5">
          <mxCell style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" as="geometry" />
