  <diagram id="page-UC-02" name="06 - Use Case - Học viên (UC-02)">
    <mxGraphModel dx="0" dy="0" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="768" pageHeight="1054" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#10;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n' Shared academic presentation; identities and authority belong in comments/index.\nskinparam monochrome true\nskinparam backgroundColor white\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam defaultFontSize 14\nskinparam defaultFontColor black\nskinparam titleFontSize 18\nskinparam titleFontColor black\nskinparam ArrowColor black\nskinparam ArrowThickness 1\nskinparam roundCorner 0\nskinparam nodesep 35\nskinparam ranksep 45\nskinparam ActorBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActorBorderColor black\nskinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ParticipantBorderColor black\nskinparam ControlBackgroundColor white\nskinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white\nskinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ClassBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ClassBorderColor black\nskinparam ClassHeaderBackgroundColor white\nskinparam EntityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam EntityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor black\nskinparam StateBackgroundColor white\nskinparam StateBorderColor black\nskinparam PackageBackgroundColor white\nskinparam PackageBorderColor #555555\nskinparam RectangleBackgroundColor white\nskinparam RectangleBorderColor black\nskinparam NoteBackgroundColor white\nskinparam NoteBorderColor black\nskinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #555555\nskinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white\nskinparam sequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor white\n' diagram-id: VIEW-UC-02\n' classification: TARGET\n' Mapping: signup/recovery/profile = UC-01; contexts/starting choices support UC-01/02/04.\n' Path = UC-04; lesson = UC-06; vocabulary = UC-07; level-up = UC-05; progress = UC-08.\n' Login is presentation-only, within UC-01; no new canonical UC.\n' Authority: ADR-031–036. Max two ACTIVE contexts; PAUSED retains state and global SRS.\n' Placement recommends starting level only; self-report/default create no assessment result.\n' Lesson: N core exercises; K first-wrong items retry once; performance denominator N+K.\n' Completion independent of correctness; latest completed performance is primary.\n' Core vocabulary auto-enrolls after completion; optional vocabulary is learner-added.\n' SRS identity User+Vocabulary; Policy B 1,3,7,14,30 days then recurring 30 days.\n' ADR-041: no learner due-list browsing; the system selects questions for ordinary/dedicated sessions.\n' SRS is outside scored immutable Placement/Level-up Assessment Versions.\n' Unavailable requirements excluded from progress; withdrawal/replacement preserve history.\n' Reassessment/reminder deferred and excluded from active view.\nleft to right direction\ntitle Sơ đồ Use Case của Học viên\n\nactor \&quot;Học viên\&quot; as Learner\nrectangle \&quot;HỆ THỐNG HỌC NGOẠI NGỮ LINGORA\&quot; {\n  package \&quot;Tài khoản\&quot; {\n    usecase \&quot;Đăng ký tài khoản\&quot; as Signup\n    usecase \&quot;Khôi phục mật khẩu\&quot; as Recovery\n    usecase \&quot;Quản lý hồ sơ cá nhân\&quot; as Profile\n    usecase \&quot;Đăng nhập / Xác thực\&quot; as Login\n  }\n  package \&quot;Học tập\&quot; {\n    usecase \&quot;Quản lý ngữ cảnh học\&quot; as Context\n    usecase \&quot;Chọn điểm bắt đầu học\&quot; as Start\n    usecase \&quot;Khám phá lộ trình học\&quot; as Path\n    usecase \&quot;Học bài và luyện tập\&quot; as Lesson\n    usecase \&quot;Học từ vựng và ôn tập\&quot; as SRS\n    usecase \&quot;Kiểm tra lên cấp\&quot; as LevelUp\n    usecase \&quot;Xem tiến độ và chuỗi ngày học\&quot; as Progress\n  }\n}\nLearner -- Signup\nLearner -- Recovery\nLearner -- Profile\nLearner -- Login\nLearner -- Context\nLearner -- Start\nLearner -- Path\nLearner -- Lesson\nLearner -- SRS\nLearner -- LevelUp\nLearner -- Progress\n\nProfile ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nContext ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nStart ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nPath ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nLesson ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nSRS ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nLevelUp ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nProgress ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n@enduml\n\n&quot;,&#10;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#10;}" id="plantuml-6">
