        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#10;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n' Shared academic presentation; identities and authority belong in comments/index.\nskinparam monochrome true\nskinparam backgroundColor white\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam defaultFontSize 14\nskinparam defaultFontColor black\nskinparam titleFontSize 18\nskinparam titleFontColor black\nskinparam ArrowColor black\nskinparam ArrowThickness 1\nskinparam roundCorner 0\nskinparam nodesep 35\nskinparam ranksep 45\nskinparam ActorBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActorBorderColor black\nskinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ParticipantBorderColor black\nskinparam ControlBackgroundColor white\nskinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white\nskinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ClassBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ClassBorderColor black\nskinparam ClassHeaderBackgroundColor white\nskinparam EntityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam EntityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor black\nskinparam StateBackgroundColor white\nskinparam StateBorderColor black\nskinparam PackageBackgroundColor white\nskinparam PackageBorderColor #555555\nskinparam RectangleBackgroundColor white\nskinparam RectangleBorderColor black\nskinparam NoteBackgroundColor white\nskinparam NoteBorderColor black\nskinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #555555\nskinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white\nskinparam sequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor white\n' diagram-id: VIEW-UC-03\n' classification: TARGET\n' Maps to UC-01/10/11; VIEW-UC-03 is not canonical reminder UC-03.\n' Activation/profile/Login = UC-01; worklist/edit/preview = UC-10; submission/history = UC-11.\n' Login is supporting presentation only; no canonical UC added.\n' Authority: ADR-034–036. Teacher authors only assigned work, follows Admin blueprint.\n' Edit only DRAFT/CHANGES_REQUESTED; no approval/publication or staff-account learning.\n' Readiness checks coverage, grading data, required media and completeness.\n' Answer-exposed practice items cannot be reused verbatim in assessments.\nleft to right direction\ntitle Sơ đồ Use Case của Giáo viên\n\nactor \&quot;Giáo viên\&quot; as Teacher\nrectangle \&quot;HỆ THỐNG HỌC NGOẠI NGỮ LINGORA\&quot; {\n  usecase \&quot;Kích hoạt tài khoản\&quot; as Activation\n  usecase \&quot;Quản lý hồ sơ cá nhân\&quot; as Profile\n  usecase \&quot;Xem công việc được phân công\&quot; as Worklist\n  usecase \&quot;Soạn bài học và câu hỏi đánh giá\&quot; as Edit\n  usecase \&quot;Xem trước nội dung\&quot; as Preview\n  usecase \&quot;Nộp bài và nộp lại\&quot; as Submit\n  usecase \&quot;Xem phản hồi và lịch sử\&quot; as History\n  usecase \&quot;Đăng nhập / Xác thực\&quot; as Login\n}\nTeacher -- Activation\nTeacher -- Profile\nTeacher -- Worklist\nTeacher -- Edit\nTeacher -- Preview\nTeacher -- Submit\nTeacher -- History\nTeacher -- Login\n\nProfile ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nWorklist ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nEdit ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nPreview ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nSubmit ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nHistory ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#10;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#10;}" id="plantuml-7">
