  <diagram id="page-UC-04" name="08 - Use Case - Quản trị viên (UC-04)">
    <mxGraphModel dx="0" dy="0" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="837" pageHeight="1334" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#10;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n' Shared academic presentation; identities and authority belong in comments/index.\nskinparam monochrome true\nskinparam backgroundColor white\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam defaultFontSize 14\nskinparam defaultFontColor black\nskinparam titleFontSize 18\nskinparam titleFontColor black\nskinparam ArrowColor black\nskinparam ArrowThickness 1\nskinparam roundCorner 0\nskinparam nodesep 35\nskinparam ranksep 45\nskinparam ActorBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActorBorderColor black\nskinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ParticipantBorderColor black\nskinparam ControlBackgroundColor white\nskinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white\nskinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ClassBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ClassBorderColor black\nskinparam ClassHeaderBackgroundColor white\nskinparam EntityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam EntityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor black\nskinparam StateBackgroundColor white\nskinparam StateBorderColor black\nskinparam PackageBackgroundColor white\nskinparam PackageBorderColor #555555\nskinparam RectangleBackgroundColor white\nskinparam RectangleBorderColor black\nskinparam NoteBackgroundColor white\nskinparam NoteBorderColor black\nskinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #555555\nskinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white\nskinparam sequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor white\n' diagram-id: VIEW-UC-04\n' classification: TARGET\n' Maps to UC-01/09/12/13/14; VIEW-UC-04 is not canonical learner-path UC-04.\n' Profile/Login = UC-01; curriculum/blueprint/assignment = UC-09; accounts = UC-13.\n' Review/changes/approval/publication/archive = UC-12; reports/audit = UC-14.\n' Supporting presentation only; no canonical UC added.\n' Authority: ADR-034–036. Admin cannot author content, bypass approval or edit learner evidence.\n' One responsible Teacher per Lesson package; reassignment preserves attribution/history.\n' Support reads necessary identity/status/minimal context summary; account actions audited.\n' Assessment publication requires readiness/review/approval; immutable version pins attempts.\n' Published revision replacement is atomic; privileged actions emit security audit events.\nleft to right direction\ntitle Sơ đồ Use Case của Quản trị viên\n\nactor \&quot;Quản trị viên\&quot; as Admin\nrectangle \&quot;HỆ THỐNG HỌC NGOẠI NGỮ LINGORA\&quot; {\n  package \&quot;Tài khoản và vận hành\&quot; {\n    usecase \&quot;Quản lý hồ sơ cá nhân\&quot; as Profile\n    usecase \&quot;Quản lý tài khoản học viên, giáo viên\&quot; as Accounts\n    usecase \&quot;Xem báo cáo và nhật ký\&quot; as Audit\n    usecase \&quot;Đăng nhập / Xác thực\&quot; as Login\n  }\n  package \&quot;Đề cương và phân công\&quot; {\n    usecase \&quot;Quản lý cấu trúc và cấu hình khóa học\&quot; as Curriculum\n    usecase \&quot;Lập đề cương bài đánh giá\&quot; as Blueprint\n    usecase \&quot;Phân công và phân công lại\&quot; as Assign\n  }\n  package \&quot;Thẩm định và xuất bản\&quot; {\n    usecase \&quot;Thẩm định nội dung đã nộp\&quot; as Review\n    usecase \&quot;Yêu cầu chỉnh sửa\&quot; as Changes\n    usecase \&quot;Phê duyệt nội dung\&quot; as Approve\n    usecase \&quot;Xuất bản bài học đã duyệt\&quot; as Publish\n    usecase \&quot;Xuất bản phiên bản đánh giá đã duyệt\&quot; as Assessment\n    usecase \&quot;Lưu trữ hoặc thu hồi nội dung\&quot; as Archive\n  }\n}\nAdmin -- Profile\nAdmin -- Accounts\nAdmin -- Audit\nAdmin -- Login\nAdmin -- Curriculum\nAdmin -- Blueprint\nAdmin -- Assign\nAdmin -- Review\nAdmin -- Changes\nAdmin -- Approve\nAdmin -- Publish\nAdmin -- Assessment\nAdmin -- Archive\n\nProfile ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nAccounts ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nAudit ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nCurriculum ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nBlueprint ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nAssign ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nReview ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nChanges ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nApprove ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nPublish ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nAssessment ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nArchive ..&gt; Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#10;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#10;}" id="plantuml-8">
          <mxCell style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="1">
