ED : Một giáo viên phụ trách tại một thời điểm\n' Responsibility is separate from revision/content lifecycle; Teacher worklist follows current ownership.\n' No CLOSED/COMPLETED or project-management workflow is approved by ADR-034/035.\n' Assignment remains a logical concept; no stored status or history representation is prescribed.\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#10;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#10;}" id="plantuml-27">
