  <diagram id="page-DOM-01" name="29 - Domain - Mô hình miền Lingora (DOM-01)">
    <mxGraphModel dx="0" dy="0" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="4160" pageHeight="2760" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;:&quot;@startuml\n' Shared academic presentation; identities and authority belong in comments/index.\nskinparam monochrome true\nskinparam backgroundColor white\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam defaultFontSize 14\nskinparam defaultFontColor black\nskinparam titleFontSize 18\nskinparam titleFontColor black\nskinparam ArrowColor black\nskinparam ArrowThickness 1\nskinparam roundCorner 0\nskinparam nodesep 35\nskinparam ranksep 45\nskinparam ActorBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActorBorderColor black\nskinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ParticipantBorderColor black\nskinparam ControlBackgroundColor white\nskinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white\nskinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ClassBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ClassBorderColor black\nskinparam ClassHeaderBackgroundColor white\nskinparam EntityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam EntityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor black\nskinparam StateBackgroundColor white\nskinparam StateBorderColor black\nskinparam PackageBackgroundColor white\nskinparam PackageBorderColor #555555\nskinparam RectangleBackgroundColor white\nskinparam RectangleBorderColor black\nskinparam NoteBackgroundColor white\nskinparam NoteBorderColor black\nskinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #555555\nskinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white\nskinparam sequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor white\n' diagram-id: DOM-01\n' classification: TARGET\n' Authority: ADR-030–036/041/042 + yêu cầu PO 2026-10-12 class-design-completion.\n' Model logical design; không schema/SQL/FK/API/implementation.\n' Assignment là lượt giao; giữ prior episode, at most 1 active per content target.\n' AssessmentBlueprintVersion/Item immutable sau publish/use; gradingData chỉ server.\n' Plan/Progress dẫn xuất; không default persisted; score != completion/proficiency.\n' Course/Unit visibility derived; không copy content lifecycle hoặc fixed English counts.\ntitle Sơ đồ lớp thiết kế miền Lingora\nhide circle\nhide empty methods\nskinparam classAttributeIconSize 0\nskinparam nodesep 85\nskinparam ranksep 130\nskinparam defaultFontSize 16\nskinparam linetype spline\nskinparam minClassWidth 360\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\nleft to right direction\n\npackage \&quot;Identity / Learner\&quot; {\n  class User {\n    id: Identifier\n    email: String\n    role: Admin | Teacher | Learner\n    status: AccountStatus\n  }\n\n  class Profile {\n    displayName: String\n    locale: String\n    nativeLanguage: Reference[0..1]\n    timezone: TimeZone\n    streak: Integer\n  }\n\n  class LearningContext {\n    id: Identifier\n    status: ACTIVE | PAUSED\n    purpose: LearningPurpose\n    studyFocus: StudyFocus = BALANCED\n    studyPreferences: Reference[0..1]\n    startingPoint: Level\n    startingPointSource: String\n    selfReportedLevel: Reference[0..1]\n    /workingLevel: Level\n    assessmentAttempts: Reference[*]\n  }\n\n  enum StudyFocus {\n    BALANCED\n    VOCABULARY\n    GRAMMAR\n    READING\n    LISTENING\n  }\n\n  class LessonAttempt {\n    id: Identifier\n    completed: Boolean\n    performance: Percentage[0..1]\n    completedAt: DateTime[0..1]\n    contributionSum: Number\n    responseCount: Integer\n    responses: Reference[*]\n  }\n\n}\n\npackage \&quot;Curriculum / Content\&quot; {\n  class Language {\n    code: String\n    name: String\n  }\n\n  class ProficiencyFramework {\n    name: String\n    version: String\n  }\n\n  class Level {\n    label: String\n  }\n\n  class Course {\n    id: Identifier\n    title: String\n    curriculumGate: Reference\n  }\n\n  class Unit {\n    id: Identifier\n    code: String\n    title: String\n    orderIndex: Integer\n  }\n\n  class Lesson {\n    id: Identifier\n    title: String\n    orderIndex: Integer\n    required: Boolean\n    availability: CurriculumAvailability\n    topicRefs: Reference[*]\n    skillRefs: Reference[*]\n    purposeTags: LearningPurpose[*]\n  }\n\n  class Vocabulary {\n    id: Identifier\n    term: String\n    definition: String\n    pronunciation: String[0..1]\n    partOfSpeech: String[0..1]\n    example: String[0..1]\n  }\n\n}\n\npackage \&quot;Authoring / Governance\&quot; {\n  class Exercise {\n    id: Identifier\n    orderIndex: Integer\n    type: ExerciseType\n    core: Boolean\n    practiceSkillRefs: Reference[*]\n    knowledgeArea: String\n    prompt: String\n    options: String[*]\n    gradingData: Reference {server-only}\n    mediaRefs: Reference[*]\n  }\n\n  class Assignment {\n    id: Identifier\n    assignedAt: DateTime\n    endedAt: DateTime[0..1]\n    /active: Boolean\n    requirements: String\n    scope: String\n    checklist: String[*]\n    previousAssignment: Reference[0..1]\n  }\n\n  class ContentRevision {\n    id: Identifier\n    revisionNumber: Integer\n    status: ContentStatus\n    author: Reference\n    createdAt: DateTime\n    previousRevision: Reference[0..1]\n    changeSummary: String[0..1]\n    assignment: Assignment\n    learnerContent: Reference\n    mediaRefs: Reference[*]\n    vocabularyMemberships: Reference[*]\n    submissionReviewHistory: Reference[*]\n  }\n\n  class SecurityAuditEvent {\n    id: Identifier\n    actorKind: String\n    verifiedAuthSubjectId: Identifier[0..1]\n    action: String\n    targetType: String\n    targetId: Identifier\n    targetVersion: Reference[0..1]\n    serverTime: DateTime\n    outcome: String\n    reason: String[0..1]\n  }\n\n}\n\npackage \&quot;Assessment\&quot; {\n  class AssessmentBlueprint {\n    id: Identifier\n    purpose: Placement | LevelUp\n    language: Reference\n    framework: Reference\n    levelScope: Reference[0..1]\n    nextLevelScope: Reference[0..1]\n    coverage: Reference[*]\n    itemRequirements: Reference[*]\n    curriculumScope: Course\n    configuredBy: User {Admin}\n  }\n\n  class AssessmentBlueprintVersion {\n    id: Identifier\n    versionNumber: Integer\n    status: ContentStatus\n    purposeSnapshot: Placement | LevelUp\n    languageSnapshot: Reference\n    frameworkSnapshot: Reference\n    levelScopeSnapshot: Reference[0..1]\n    nextLevelSnapshot: Reference[0..1]\n    topicCoverageSnapshot: Reference[*]\n    skillCoverageSnapshot: Reference[*]\n    curriculumCoverageSnapshot: Reference\n    itemRequirementsSnapshot: Reference[*]\n    itemCount: Integer\n    timeLimitMinutes: Integer[0..1]\n    passThreshold: Percentage[0..1]\n    resultPolicySnapshot: Reference\n    gradingPolicySnapshot: Reference {server-only}\n    publishedAt: DateTime[0..1]\n    /immutable: Boolean\n    submissionReviewHistory: Reference[*]\n  }\n\n  class AssessmentResult {\n    id: Identifier\n    purpose: Placement | LevelUp\n    assessmentType: Reference\n    deliveryMode: Reference\n    score: Percentage\n    outcome: String[0..1]\n    recommendation: Level[0..1]\n    completedAt: DateTime\n    provenance: Reference\n  }\n\n  class AssessmentItem {\n    id: Identifier\n    type: ExerciseType\n    prompt: String\n    options: String[*]\n    topicSkillRefs: Reference[*]\n    levelScope: Reference[0..1]\n    gradingData: Reference {server-only}\n    mediaRefs: Reference[*]\n    authoring: Reference\n  }\n\n}\n\npackage \&quot;Progress / SRS\&quot; {\n  class LearningPlan &lt;&lt;derived&gt;&gt; {\n    orderedLessons: Lesson[*]\n  }\n\n  class Progress &lt;&lt;derived&gt;&gt; {\n    /completedRequiredLessons: Integer\n    /eligibleRequiredLessons: Integer\n    /completionRatio: Number[0..1]\n  }\n\n  class SrsCard {\n    id: Identifier\n    stage: Integer\n    dueAt: DateTime\n    enrollmentSource: String\n    reviewHistory: Reference[*]\n  }\n\n}\n\nUser \&quot;1\&quot; *-- \&quot;1\&quot; Profile\nUser \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; LearningContext : Learner sở hữu\nLearningContext \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..1\&quot; LearningPlan : dẫn xuất\nLearningContext \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; Progress : tiến độ\nLanguage \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; Course : chương trình\nProficiencyFramework \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;1..*\&quot; Level : định nghĩa\nCourse \&quot;1\&quot; *-- \&quot;0..*\&quot; Unit : các nhóm bài\nUnit \&quot;1\&quot; *-- \&quot;0..*\&quot; Lesson : các bài học\nLesson \&quot;0..*\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; Vocabulary : nội dung từ\nLearningContext \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; LessonAttempt : lượt học\nLessonAttempt \&quot;0..*\&quot; -- \&quot;1\&quot; Lesson : bài đã học\nUser \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; SrsCard : Learner ghi nhớ\nSrsCard \&quot;0..*\&quot; -- \&quot;1\&quot; Vocabulary : từ được ôn\nAssessmentBlueprint \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; AssessmentBlueprintVersion : các snapshot\nAssessmentBlueprintVersion \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; AssessmentResult : bằng chứng\nLearningContext \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; AssessmentResult : kết quả\nAssignment \&quot;0..*\&quot; -- \&quot;1\&quot; User : Teacher được giao\nAssignment \&quot;0..*\&quot; -- \&quot;1\&quot; Lesson : gói nội dung\nLesson \&quot;1\&quot; *-- \&quot;0..*\&quot; ContentRevision : các bản sửa\nContentRevision \&quot;1\&quot; *-- \&quot;0..*\&quot; Exercise : bài tập\nAssessmentBlueprintVersion \&quot;1\&quot; *-- \&quot;0..*\&quot; AssessmentItem : item snapshots\nUser \&quot;0..1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; SecurityAuditEvent : thao tác\nLearningContext \&quot;0..*\&quot; -- \&quot;1\&quot; Language : ngôn ngữ học\nUnit \&quot;0..*\&quot; -- \&quot;1\&quot; Level : cấp nội dung\nUser \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; Assignment : Admin giao việc\nVocabulary \&quot;0..*\&quot; -- \&quot;1\&quot; Language : ngôn ngữ từ\nProgress \&quot;0..*\&quot; -- \&quot;1\&quot; Level : phạm vi cấp\nLessonAttempt \&quot;0..*\&quot; -- \&quot;1\&quot; ContentRevision : bản đã học\n\n' Bounded references and relationship constraints: class-review-2026-10-16.md.\n' assessmentAttempts pins Context+Version before any Result; no persistence/resume assumed.\n' Core/optional vocabularyMemberships belong to the completed ContentRevision.\n' authoring/assignment and submissionReviewHistory retain Teacher attribution and feedback.\n' SecurityAuditEvent.actorKind nhận ACCOUNT, SYSTEM hoặc VERIFIED_AUTH_SUBJECT; ACCOUNT bắt buộc đúng một User và không có verifiedAuthSubjectId; SYSTEM không có actor reference; VERIFIED_AUTH_SUBJECT không có User và bắt buộc verifiedAuthSubjectId. Account-required actions không thể thiếu User; không tạo business role thứ tư hay tài khoản hệ thống giả.\n' Composition never means cascade deletion of referenced learning evidence.\n' Supplementary SRS/focus practice never enters pinned assessments or core performance.\n' Version/Revision draft có thể 0 items; publish cần readiness theo configuration.\n' User→Context 0..* gồm cả lịch sử PAUSED; tối đa 2 ACTIVE là rule, không tổng số rows.\n' Không Enrollment, generic workflow/versioning/item pool hoặc CRUD methods.\n@enduml\n&quot;,&quot;config&quot;:null}" id="plantuml-29">
